As has been pointed out, this will give a big advantage to people who
play with larger screens. That's not to say that it would never work,
but it's not as simple as it sounds to make things fair (and to make
the game equally enjoyable for all players -- one of the things I
*like* about NetHack is that the level fits on one screen!).
 
